		(uuid "1c30d2b0-a905-44d1-91d4-950a0be180fa")
	)
	(text_box "U2 - TPS259480A eFuse (J1 input protection)\nAuto-retry, reverse-current blocking always on\n\nOVLO:   470k / 31.2k (0.5%)  → trips 19.3 V, recovers 17.7 V\nUVLO:   470k / 45.3k (1%)    → on 13.7 V, off 12.5 V (≈3.1 V/cell)\nILIM:   576 Ω (1%)           → 8.4 A limit (fast-trip ≈15 A)\n        Requires 2× V+ / 2× GND pins on J1\nITIMER: 2.2 nF C0G           → ≈1.75 ms overcurrent blanking\ndVdt:   4.7 nF C0G 50 V      → ≈16 ms soft-start, ≈0.5 A inrush @ 470 µF\n\nSPLYGD: NC (only needed for dual-input power muxing)\nFLT:    Open-drain, active low → fault LED, supplied from VBAT\n        via 4.7k + 4.7 V Zener (clamps pin < 5 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.065 105.3615 0)
		(size 77.47 30.5285)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
